      "sectionId": "other-styles",
      "timeSignature": { "numerator": 4, "denominator": 4 },
      "subdivision": "8th",
      "notes": "Kick on every beat, snare on 2 and 4, hi-hat on every eighth. The defining groove of disco, house, EDM, and many dance contexts. The constant kick creates relentless forward motion.",
