      "timeSignature": { "numerator": 12, "denominator": 8 },
      "subdivision": "8th",
      "notes": "Triplet-feel groove in 12/8. The hi-hat plays a shuffle pattern (first and third note of each triplet), kick on beats 1 and 3, snare backbeat on 2 and 4. Used in blues, swing, country, and shuffle-feel rock.",
